{"words": [{"text": "وَلَا", "translation": "And (do) not"}, {"text": "تَنكِحُوا۟", "translation": "[you] marry"}, {"text": "ٱلْمُشْرِكَـٰتِ", "translation": "[the] polytheistic women"}, {"text": "حَتَّىٰ", "translation": "until"}, {"text": "يُؤْمِنَّ ۚ", "translation": "they believe"}, {"text": "وَلَأَمَةٌۭ", "translation": "And a bondwoman"}, {"text": "مُّؤْمِنَةٌ", "translation": "(who is) believing"}, {"text": "خَيْرٌۭ", "translation": "(is) better"}, {"text": "مِّن", "translation": "than"}, {"text": "مُّشْرِكَةٍۢ", "translation": "a polytheistic woman"}, {"text": "وَلَوْ", "translation": "[and] even if"}, {"text": "أَعْجَبَتْكُمْ ۗ", "translation": "she pleases you"}, {"text": "وَلَا", "translation": "And (do) not"}, {"text": "تُنكِحُوا۟", "translation": "give in marriage (your women)"}, {"text": "ٱلْمُشْرِكِينَ", "translation": "(to) [the] polytheistic men"}, {"text": "حَتَّىٰ", "translation": "until"}, {"text": "يُؤْمِنُوا۟ ۚ", "translation": "they believe"}, {"text": "وَلَعَبْدٌۭ", "translation": "and a bondman"}, {"text": "مُّؤْمِنٌ", "translation": "(who is) believing"}, {"text": "خَيْرٌۭ", "translation": "(is) better"}, {"text": "مِّن", "translation": "than"}, {"text": "مُّشْرِكٍۢ", "translation": "a polytheistic man"}, {"text": "وَلَوْ", "translation": "[and] even if"}, {"text": "أَعْجَبَكُمْ ۗ", "translation": "he pleases you"}, {"text": "أُو۟لَـٰٓئِكَ", "translation": "[Those]"}, {"text": "يَدْعُونَ", "translation": "they invite"}, {"text": "إِلَى", "translation": "to"}, {"text": "ٱلنَّارِ ۖ", "translation": "the Fire"}, {"text": "وَٱللَّهُ", "translation": "and Allah"}, {"text": "يَدْعُوٓا۟", "translation": "invites"}, {"text": "إِلَى", "translation": "to"}, {"text": "ٱلْجَنَّةِ", "translation": "Paradise"}, {"text": "وَٱلْمَغْفِرَةِ", "translation": "and [the] forgiveness"}, {"text": "بِإِذْنِهِۦ ۖ", "translation": "by His permission"}, {"text": "وَيُبَيِّنُ", "translation": "And He makes clear"}, {"text": "ءَايَـٰتِهِۦ", "translation": "His Verses"}, {"text": "لِلنَّاسِ", "translation": "for the people"}, {"text": "لَعَلَّهُمْ", "translation": "so that they may"}, {"text": "يَتَذَكَّرُونَ", "translation": "take heed"}], "sahih": "And do not marry polytheistic women until they believe.1 And a believing slave woman is better than a polytheist, even though she might please you. And do not marry polytheistic men [to your women] until they believe. And a believing slave is better than a polytheist, even though he might please you. Those invite [you] to the Fire, but Allāh invites to Paradise and to forgiveness, by His permission. And He makes clear His verses [i.e., ordinances] to the people that perhaps they may remember."}